title: scene_outside
---
// (czarny ekran)

That was a week ago.
Since then Ariel has been traveling to get to his final destination.
Natum Amoris.
The town he’s been sent to by the church. 
After an exhausting journey he finally saw a light contour of the town. 
It grew on the horizon, getting bigger by the minute, symbolizing that the trip was about to end.

<<bg town_day>>
<<show ariel basic left>>

Ariel finds himself standing by the gate to the town, searching for the church.
He couldn’t find it and he didn’t really get any particular instruction.
The best thing he can do is simply ask someone for directions. 

Ariel: Excuse me, ma’am.
Ariel: Do you know which way would take me to the church?

An old lady turned to look at Ariel.
She smiled at him but it wasn’t that cute old lady smile Ariel expected.
There was something weird about it…
Something sinister…

Old lady: Of course I’ll help you, sweet little boy.
Old lady: Are you the new Priest who was supposed to be sent to us?
Old lady: I'm glad they sent us such a cutie.

// <<show ariel blush left>>

At first Ariel was shocked, but then he remembered.
The village was festering with sin.
He knew that, but this nice, sweet lady didn’t fit into that scenario…

Or did she? 
-> So… Do you know where the church is?
   Old Lady: Uhh, you're no fun.
   Old Lady: What a waste of a pretty face.
   Old Lady: The church is this way.
-> Thank you so much sweetie. Will you tell me now, pretty lady, where the church is?
   Old Lady: Of course, hot stuff.
   Old Lady:The church is over there.

// <<show ariel basic left>>

The old lady pointed the way.
It seems that the church is on the other side of the town.

<<hide ariel>>

Ariel rushed through the city.
As he rushed through narrow alleyways and crowded streets he felt the weight of the air.
Thick in his lungs, trying to suffocate him.
The situation in the city is way worse than he originally thought and he could feel it now.
He felt as if the weight of the sin surrounding this place was trying to crush him. 
He reached the church's doors at last.
Without thinking Ariel pushed the door open, storming inside to catch a breath.

<<jump scene_faust>>
===
